# Hybrid Intelligent Cold Chain Quality Assurance System

Deployment Link: https://hybrid-cold-storage-monitoring.netlify.app/

## 📌 Project Overview

The **Hybrid Intelligent Cold Chain Quality Assurance System** is an IoT-based smart monitoring and control system designed to ensure the safe transportation and storage of temperature-sensitive products such as:

* Vaccines
* Pharmaceuticals
* Perishable food products
* Biologics

The system continuously monitors environmental conditions inside a cold-storage container and automatically takes corrective actions when unsafe conditions are detected.

This project combines:

* IoT Monitoring
* Embedded Systems
* Automatic Cooling Control
* Cloud Monitoring
* AI-based Prediction
* Digital Temperature Integrity Seal (TIS)

---

# 🎯 Problem Statement

Temperature-sensitive products can become unsafe if exposed to temperatures outside their safe range.

Traditional systems:

* Detect problems too late
* Depend on manual monitoring
* Lack proof of temperature violations
* Cannot predict future failures

This project solves these issues using intelligent real-time monitoring and automation.

---

# 🌍 SDG Alignment

## 🟢 SDG 3 – Good Health and Well-being

This project supports SDG 3 by:

* Ensuring vaccine safety
* Preventing pharmaceutical spoilage
* Improving healthcare logistics
* Protecting patient safety

---

# 🚀 Main Objectives

* Monitor temperature and humidity in real time
* Automatically cool the storage box using Peltier cooling
* Alert users when temperature becomes unsafe
* Send live data to the cloud
* Predict future temperature risks
* Maintain a permanent failure record if temperature limits are violated

---

# 🧠 System Features

## ✅ Real-Time Monitoring

The ESP32 continuously reads:

* Temperature
* Humidity

using:

* DHT11 sensor
* DS18B20 sensor

---

## ✅ Automatic Cooling System

If temperature rises above the safe limit:

* Peltier cooler turns ON
* Cooling fan turns ON

If temperature returns to normal:

* Cooling system turns OFF

---

## ✅ Smart Alerts

When unsafe temperature is detected:

* LED indicator turns ON
* Buzzer alarm activates

---

## ✅ Cloud Dashboard

Sensor data is uploaded to:

* ThingSpeak / Firebase

Users can:

* View live temperature
* Monitor humidity
* Analyze graphs remotely

---

## ✅ AI-Based Prediction

The system predicts:

* Temperature rise trends
* Possible cooling failures
* Risk of spoilage before it happens

---

## ✅ Digital Temperature Integrity Seal (TIS)

If temperature exceeds safe limits even once:

```text
STATUS = FAILED
```

The failed status remains permanent even if temperature becomes normal later.

This acts as a digital proof of quality breach.

---

# 🏗️ System Architecture

## Phase 1 – Sensor Layer

Components:

* ESP32
* DHT11
* DS18B20

Function:

* Read environmental conditions

---

## Phase 2 – Alert Layer

Components:

* LED
* Buzzer

Function:

* Alert users during unsafe conditions

---

## Phase 3 – Cooling Layer

Components:

* Peltier Module
* Cooling Fan
* Relay/MOSFET

Function:

* Automatically cool storage chamber

---

## Phase 4 – Cloud Layer

Platforms:

* ThingSpeak / Firebase

Function:

* Store and visualize real-time data

---

## Phase 5 – AI Analytics Layer

Function:

* Detect abnormal trends
* Predict future temperature rise

---

## Phase 6 – Integrity Layer

Function:

* Permanently record quality violations

---

# 🔧 Hardware Components Required

| Component      | Purpose                       |
| -------------- | ----------------------------- |
| ESP32          | Main microcontroller          |
| DHT11          | Humidity + temperature sensor |
| DS18B20        | Accurate temperature sensor   |
| Peltier Module | Cooling                       |
| Cooling Fan    | Heat dissipation              |
| Relay/MOSFET   | Control high-power devices    |
| LED            | Visual alert                  |
| Buzzer         | Audio alert                   |
| Breadboard     | Circuit prototyping           |
| Jumper Wires   | Connections                   |
| Power Supply   | External power                |

---

# 💻 Software & Technologies Used

| Technology            | Purpose              |
| --------------------- | -------------------- |
| Arduino IDE           | Programming ESP32    |
| Embedded C/C++        | Firmware development |
| Firebase / ThingSpeak | Cloud storage        |
| HTML/CSS/JavaScript   | Dashboard            |
| Python (optional)     | AI prediction        |
| IoT                   | Real-time monitoring |

---

# ⚙️ Working Principle

1. Sensors continuously monitor conditions.
2. ESP32 processes the data.
3. If temperature becomes unsafe:

   * Alerts activate
   * Cooling system starts
4. Data is uploaded to cloud dashboard.
5. AI module predicts future risks.
6. If limits are violated:

   * Integrity status permanently changes to FAILED.

